WEBVTT

00:12.637 --> 00:14.806
Get back here, offering!

00:18.852 --> 00:22.897
It's only a matter of time
until my target dies.

00:25.233 --> 00:26.901
Super complete.

00:27.694 --> 00:31.156
Is he gonna hit me with the Sound Masters'
Modified Bloodline Increment?

00:37.495 --> 00:39.914
He was just bluffing
so he could run away?

00:41.750 --> 00:44.919
Where is it?
If I find it before he does...

00:45.211 --> 00:49.174
I super win this fight.

00:51.843 --> 00:56.014
Those who ceaselessly hone
their killing arts are known as "Masters."

00:56.097 --> 01:01.394
After many generations,
they have gained lethal abilities

01:01.478 --> 01:03.938
called "Modified Bloodlines."

01:04.272 --> 01:10.195
This is the story of one such Master,
the Sound Master, Genya Naruko,

01:10.278 --> 01:12.947
and his super search for healing.

01:21.706 --> 01:25.168
Locked in Latata

01:25.251 --> 01:28.838
Secrets in my veins Latata

01:28.922 --> 01:30.590
I know you want it

01:30.673 --> 01:32.383
And sure, I love it

01:32.467 --> 01:36.679
So I stay behind the mask Latata

01:36.763 --> 01:40.016
Run, run, run back to back Run

01:40.099 --> 01:43.853
Fun, fun, fun unpredictable but fun

01:43.937 --> 01:46.105
At the end of every mind game

01:46.189 --> 01:50.068
Shoot through the darkened night

01:50.151 --> 01:53.279
Poisoned in our bodies still

01:53.363 --> 01:57.951
Laugh at us our reckless souls

01:58.034 --> 01:59.244
TOXIC

01:59.327 --> 02:01.579
For you I will

02:01.663 --> 02:02.831
TOXIC

02:02.914 --> 02:05.291
Rewrite my destiny

02:05.375 --> 02:08.795
Losing it, falling for you

02:08.878 --> 02:12.257
What's tomorrow Kill or Kiss

02:12.340 --> 02:13.424
TOXIC

02:13.508 --> 02:15.760
Tell me what you want

02:15.844 --> 02:17.011
TOXIC

02:17.095 --> 02:19.347
I'll stay right here

02:19.430 --> 02:22.809
Like a spell, I'll be by your side

02:22.892 --> 02:26.521
What you gonna do Kill or Kiss

02:30.483 --> 02:33.027
Kill or Kiss

02:34.154 --> 02:36.573
Kill or Kiss

02:37.657 --> 02:39.951
Kill or Kiss

02:47.041 --> 02:50.211
You're cruel, Poison Master.

02:51.379 --> 02:55.466
Even if my target survives
and becomes CEO,

02:55.550 --> 02:58.636
her troubles will only get worse.

02:59.053 --> 03:01.055
Her relatives will resent her.

03:01.139 --> 03:03.975
Human scum will try to tear her down.

03:05.310 --> 03:07.437
The responsibility's too heavy for her.

03:07.520 --> 03:11.649
My target's too fragile for competition.

03:11.733 --> 03:16.404
A weakling getting a taste of the world
of the strong super ends in tragedy.

03:17.113 --> 03:18.990
She may have room to grow

03:19.574 --> 03:21.784
and may super work her butt off.

03:22.535 --> 03:24.579
But in the world of the strong,

03:24.662 --> 03:27.665
people who are weak right now
cannot survive.

03:28.207 --> 03:32.670
Foolhardy courage wears them down
and destroys them.

03:33.171 --> 03:37.300
Super weak people are better off
living in nice, safe cages without-

03:37.383 --> 03:38.343
Hey, Naruko.

03:38.718 --> 03:40.094
Are you scared?

03:40.678 --> 03:45.350
You ought to know how tough
Ureshino really is better than I do.

03:45.767 --> 03:49.187
You amped-up her trauma,
and she still beat it on her own.

03:50.438 --> 03:53.900
She's set out to conquer
her own weaknesses.

03:53.983 --> 03:59.280
Maybe that makes her tougher than guys
like us, who got forced to be strong.

03:59.989 --> 04:02.867
We're on super different
wavelengths, you and I.

04:05.119 --> 04:06.871
I finally found it.

04:07.455 --> 04:09.832
A super perfect healing spot!

04:10.583 --> 04:16.422
Phytoncides. Healing compounds
that trees release into the air.

04:16.923 --> 04:19.676
The Sound Masters' art isn't made
for hand-to-hand combat.

04:19.759 --> 04:23.137
To play notes that will hook
my audience comprised of my enemy,

04:23.221 --> 04:26.099
I need to be in peak condition.

04:26.182 --> 04:29.310
As such, a forest
is my ideal battleground.

04:29.644 --> 04:33.064
The phytoncides will let me
fight to my fullest.

04:33.648 --> 04:35.483
No! Better than my fullest!

04:35.858 --> 04:39.195
A hollow filled with phytoncides
has the potential to push me

04:39.279 --> 04:41.739
to super new heights!

04:42.907 --> 04:44.075
Ah.

04:44.158 --> 04:46.411
It feels...

04:46.995 --> 04:49.038
incredible.

04:49.122 --> 04:54.294
The super most, super best,
super bliss I've ever felt.

04:54.669 --> 04:56.963
I control every sound in this forest

04:57.046 --> 04:59.882
and bring super certain death.

05:00.925 --> 05:03.928
Modified Bloodline++:

05:04.470 --> 05:05.513
Kannon.

05:09.100 --> 05:12.437
These aren't phytoncides.

05:12.937 --> 05:14.731
It just smells similar.

05:15.356 --> 05:16.482
Poison gas?

05:17.400 --> 05:22.363
He predicted what my technique required,
set a trap, and drove me here?

05:22.613 --> 05:24.032
But I haven't lost yet.

05:24.115 --> 05:26.242
If I spit out the poison and move away-

05:29.287 --> 05:31.080
Water-absorbent polymer?

05:31.414 --> 05:34.959
Sound Master, you're great at what you do,

05:35.418 --> 05:40.757
but moves as complicated as yours
must have special requirements.

05:41.424 --> 05:48.097
Just like I shave time off my life
to power up, you had to need healing.

05:48.598 --> 05:50.141
Phytoncides.

05:50.224 --> 05:54.979
Mixing a poisonous gas with that stuff
was a first, and it wasn't easy,

05:55.438 --> 05:57.315
but tricks like this...

05:59.984 --> 06:02.153
are more my specialty
than throwing punches.

06:12.914 --> 06:15.750
Poison Master,
I've super got to thank you...

06:15.833 --> 06:18.586
for buying into my lies.

06:19.587 --> 06:22.006
Why isn't Kinosaki picking up?

06:22.090 --> 06:24.300
Taking me down...

06:24.759 --> 06:26.928
won't stop the hysteria.

06:27.595 --> 06:28.721
We're out of options.

06:28.805 --> 06:31.265
Who's youngest after Ureshino?

06:33.643 --> 06:38.147
Ureshino! There's an old track into town
on the west side of the village.

06:40.566 --> 06:42.902
A-Actually, Ms. Kinosaki...

06:43.903 --> 06:45.279
I'm going back.

06:45.738 --> 06:46.864
To where everyone is.

06:47.240 --> 06:50.535
Are you out of your mind?
They might kill you!

06:50.618 --> 06:52.161
You need to get away before it's too-

06:52.245 --> 06:53.454
I can't!

06:53.538 --> 06:55.123
If I just save myself,

06:56.415 --> 07:00.378
they'll sacrifice someone else instead.

07:00.461 --> 07:05.758
I'll leave everyone with scars that
will hurt them their whole lives. So...

07:08.553 --> 07:11.222
I have an idea.

07:15.560 --> 07:20.148
Sorry, Osawa. We're doing this
to placate Lord Chladni.

07:20.940 --> 07:23.443
We need you to stand in for Ureshino!

07:23.526 --> 07:24.944
Please wait.

07:25.903 --> 07:26.946
What now?

07:31.075 --> 07:31.909
There she is.

07:31.993 --> 07:32.827
It's Ureshino.

07:32.910 --> 07:34.495
Grab her!

07:34.871 --> 07:37.123
Wake up, Flame Devil.

07:46.841 --> 07:49.385
Don't worry, everybody.

07:50.470 --> 07:53.806
I'll use my powers
to exorcise Lord Chladni.

07:54.515 --> 08:00.062
When you speak to a crowd of people,
relax your body and speak from the belly.

08:00.396 --> 08:02.815
If you worry you're going too slow,
that's the right pace.

08:03.316 --> 08:06.986
And use this perfume.
It's a hit with men and women.

08:07.069 --> 08:08.988
I wear it all the time.

08:09.864 --> 08:11.365
Thank you so much.

08:11.699 --> 08:13.784
You didn't have to go along
with me like this.

08:13.868 --> 08:15.661
I'm helping because I think you can do it.

08:16.454 --> 08:18.956
At least, the way you are now.

08:19.790 --> 08:22.126
But if it doesn't work, run. Okay?

08:22.210 --> 08:23.628
R-Right.

08:24.545 --> 08:28.799
It'll be fine. I can do this. I can.

08:29.383 --> 08:30.218
Now...

08:30.301 --> 08:31.636
Hold it!

08:32.053 --> 08:35.640
You expect us to believe
you can get rid of Lord Chladni?

08:36.057 --> 08:37.266
Osawa?

08:37.558 --> 08:41.479
You've just been running scared
because you don't want to get sacrificed!

08:41.562 --> 08:42.396
Yeah!

08:42.480 --> 08:43.397
All bark, no bite.

08:43.481 --> 08:45.691
If you're that strong,
why didn't you exorcise him sooner?

08:45.775 --> 08:47.860
Do you want us all to die?

08:47.944 --> 08:48.861
How could you?

08:48.945 --> 08:50.196
Coward!

08:52.532 --> 08:55.826
I was waiting for my energy to build up.

08:56.327 --> 08:59.288
That's why I came back on my own.

08:59.372 --> 09:01.249
Th-Then, exorcise him, if you can!

09:01.541 --> 09:02.750
Do it now!

09:04.502 --> 09:06.254
I want to run. I'm scared. I want to
go home. How'd I end up in this mess?

09:06.337 --> 09:08.130
I'm gonna throw up. I've had enough.
I'm not cut out for this. I'm tired.

09:08.422 --> 09:10.299
If they find out I'm bluffing now,

09:10.925 --> 09:12.843
someone will pay the price for sure.

09:13.553 --> 09:15.930
It'll ruin all their lives.

09:23.229 --> 09:25.314
I won't let that happen.

09:26.274 --> 09:29.318
Flame Devil, are you ready?

09:40.997 --> 09:43.708
You want me to blow gas on it
when you give the signal?

09:44.083 --> 09:47.086
Y-Yes. It's all dead leaves,
so I think it'll burn.

09:47.461 --> 09:50.006
I know I'm asking a lot of you.

09:50.298 --> 09:52.550
No, it's no big deal.

09:53.593 --> 09:55.428
You're the one with the hard job.

09:56.387 --> 10:01.434
You've got to make them believe
your party tricks are real magic.

10:04.270 --> 10:08.608
Flame Devil! Burst!

10:19.910 --> 10:24.332
There! Lord Chladni has, uh, passed on.

10:25.041 --> 10:27.960
So, now, um...

10:28.544 --> 10:30.796
How about we all build a campfire?

10:33.466 --> 10:37.094
Yeah? So it worked?
I'll be right with you.

10:38.471 --> 10:40.473
You dealt me a super total defeat.

10:40.765 --> 10:44.101
Like hell I did. You lost to Ureshino.

10:44.935 --> 10:48.230
To Ureshino, who's overcoming
her own weakness.

10:50.358 --> 10:51.776
I see.

10:52.026 --> 10:54.403
What are you waiting for? Finish him.

10:55.655 --> 10:58.574
The weak are fated to die sooner or later.

10:58.658 --> 11:01.202
Dying at his little brother's hands

11:01.285 --> 11:03.454
is the best he can hope for.

11:08.334 --> 11:11.337
I've never been strong.

11:13.881 --> 11:15.257
Super not even once.

11:16.884 --> 11:18.844
Why don't you finish me off?

11:20.554 --> 11:23.307
Today's a special day.
It's orientation, remember?

11:24.058 --> 11:28.604
Naruko, if you want to to be healed
from the bottom of your heart,

11:28.687 --> 11:31.357
why don't you try opening up
to someone about your weakness?

11:33.484 --> 11:35.986
Poison Master Hikaru Gero.

11:36.654 --> 11:37.988
It's super none of your business.

11:44.412 --> 11:45.538
Mr. Gero.

11:47.331 --> 11:51.168
So this is a campfire?
I've heard the legends.

11:51.544 --> 11:52.378
Gero.

11:52.878 --> 11:54.880
Ureshino says she's got a present for you.

11:55.923 --> 11:58.050
I'm not sure you'll like it, though.

11:59.385 --> 12:02.680
A Supersize Mixy-Max Mix Kit!

12:11.355 --> 12:15.276
Even with a fight to the death, that's
the most damage you've taken all day.

12:15.776 --> 12:18.195
You just don't get it, Kinosaki.

12:18.279 --> 12:20.030
This is a historic event!

12:20.114 --> 12:23.159
The world record for biggest DIY candy kit
hasn't been broken in 22 years,

12:23.242 --> 12:25.286
and this one just blew it
out of the water!

12:25.369 --> 12:26.579
Yes, yes.

12:34.920 --> 12:37.756
G-Good morning, everybody.

12:38.090 --> 12:40.342
It's almost time for breakfast.

12:41.469 --> 12:43.596
I had the weirdest dream.

12:43.804 --> 12:44.638
Me, too.

12:44.722 --> 12:47.725
Ureshino was really a witch,
and she fought a monster.

12:47.808 --> 12:49.435
She was descended from onmyoji.

12:49.518 --> 12:51.187
No, she was an elite spirit medium.

12:51.270 --> 12:54.148
I, uh, I'm just good at magic tricks.

12:58.652 --> 13:00.654
It looks like our ride's here.

13:09.038 --> 13:11.749
Thank you so much, Mr. Gero.

13:11.999 --> 13:14.376
You saved me and
you smoothed everything over.

13:14.460 --> 13:17.296
All I did was put a heavy filter
on their memories.

13:19.590 --> 13:20.841
Hey, what gives?

13:20.925 --> 13:23.177
Oh, sorry. I wasn't thinking.

13:23.260 --> 13:27.097
I picked up patting people's heads
when I praise them from my dad.

13:27.181 --> 13:29.934
Pat away, Ureshino.

13:30.017 --> 13:32.269
Gero needs to get used to compliments.

13:36.690 --> 13:38.025
There, there.

13:41.195 --> 13:46.784
Thanks to you, no one had to
feel sad, or hurt, or resentful,

13:46.867 --> 13:49.662
and I got to make the best memories ever!

13:50.412 --> 13:55.543
I'll take pride in getting
to know you as long as I live.

13:55.960 --> 13:57.127
G-Great.

13:57.211 --> 14:00.089
Anyway, don't you think that's enough?
Don't forget Kinosaki.

14:00.172 --> 14:03.717
Not nearly enough!
And I already patted Ms. Kinosaki.

14:03.801 --> 14:06.470
We got it out of the way
while you weren't looking.

14:10.015 --> 14:11.934
(Together With Me)

14:12.726 --> 14:17.690
And so, I can't accept payment.
I'll super return the full amount.

14:19.692 --> 14:22.069
Now, guess I'll get going.

14:22.611 --> 14:26.657
I'll be super first in the bath
and super refreshed in every way.

14:27.032 --> 14:28.492
Don't give me that crap!

14:28.784 --> 14:32.413
The Sound Master dropped the ball! Shit!

14:36.876 --> 14:39.670
Good thing you hired me, then, huh?

14:42.089 --> 14:45.634
Me and my partner here
will blow her into paste.

14:48.429 --> 14:50.681
You're the only one left.

14:50.764 --> 14:53.100
What? What do you want?

14:53.183 --> 14:56.228
My life? Or my fortune?

14:56.312 --> 14:57.479
Just one thing.

14:59.106 --> 15:01.901
Please train me like hell!

15:02.443 --> 15:04.153
I want to do the kind of work

15:04.236 --> 15:08.032
that takes all the gloom in the world
and blows it away.

15:08.365 --> 15:09.992
But I...

15:10.075 --> 15:11.243
I know.

15:11.744 --> 15:15.623
Balzak means more to you than life itself.

15:16.332 --> 15:20.544
You worked yourself to the bone
under my dad to make it as big as it is.

15:22.004 --> 15:25.716
It's up to you whether you accept my will.

15:26.050 --> 15:27.009
But...

15:27.551 --> 15:32.431
If Shiori shows promise,
I want you to look out for her.

15:34.433 --> 15:35.267
So...

15:37.019 --> 15:40.648
I want you to liven up the company
together with me!

15:41.482 --> 15:42.316
Please?

15:47.905 --> 15:49.323
I'll train you like hell.

15:49.406 --> 15:51.909
I warn you, I'm as strict as the devil.

15:53.410 --> 15:55.412
Mr. Gero, Ms. Kinosaki...

15:57.414 --> 15:58.248
Huh?

15:59.416 --> 16:01.502
W-Wait a second, Gero!

16:01.585 --> 16:02.878
What?

16:05.214 --> 16:06.215
Are you sure?

16:06.298 --> 16:09.051
You didn't get Ureshino's contact info.

16:10.427 --> 16:13.889
I'd only dealt with human garbage before,

16:14.431 --> 16:18.143
so it wasn't until I met Ureshino
and Himekawa that it finally hit me.

16:21.063 --> 16:25.401
This world of ours
isn't as grimy as I thought.

16:26.318 --> 16:29.279
Getting married isn't what
Ureshino needs right now.

16:29.863 --> 16:32.032
A guy like me will only get in her way.

16:32.324 --> 16:37.162
I thought through how I'd make her feel,
and that's what I decided.

16:37.746 --> 16:40.666
...thinking through how things
make them feel.

16:43.419 --> 16:45.462
Nice going, Gero.

16:49.508 --> 16:53.095
I believed you and Ureshino
could've hit it off.

16:53.595 --> 16:55.806
But we'll pick ourselves up
and move on to-

16:59.685 --> 17:01.812
P-Please wait.

17:01.895 --> 17:05.566
There's still something that
I-no, that both of us haven't done...

17:05.899 --> 17:08.402
that we haven't overcome yet!

17:09.737 --> 17:13.949
Please join me for
one last drinking party.

17:17.119 --> 17:19.538
Have you all got something to drink?

17:19.621 --> 17:20.539
Ready to go.

17:20.622 --> 17:21.623
Yeah.

17:21.707 --> 17:23.751
Okay, then. Let's get started!

17:24.209 --> 17:26.920
Cheers!

17:40.768 --> 17:44.104
Mr. Gero, did you see this week's Ropes?

17:44.188 --> 17:45.314
Ropes?

17:46.231 --> 17:49.151
Ropes, short for Twisted Ropes.
On every Sunday night at 10:30.

17:50.944 --> 17:52.112
Sorry.

17:53.947 --> 17:55.032
The other day...

17:55.324 --> 17:56.825
I rode a shark.

17:56.909 --> 17:58.619
A shark? really?

17:58.702 --> 18:02.164
Shark. Same. Chompsky. Kinosaki rode him,
too. Shark fin. I thought I was a goner.

18:11.048 --> 18:13.217
Make some conversation!

18:13.300 --> 18:15.302
They suck at talking! I mean, I knew that.

18:16.053 --> 18:19.681
And they're from completely different
worlds with nothing in common.

18:19.765 --> 18:21.558
This is hard mode.

18:21.892 --> 18:23.852
They had no problem
talking on the camping trip,

18:23.936 --> 18:27.356
but now they have the perfect chance,
they can't think of anything to say.

18:28.857 --> 18:31.693
A rift will grow between them
if this keeps up.

18:31.777 --> 18:32.945
This looks bad.

18:34.071 --> 18:36.406
I've been keeping quiet,
but they leave me no choice.

18:37.449 --> 18:40.410
I'll take charge for now.

18:41.120 --> 18:42.454
Listen, you two-

18:43.372 --> 18:44.373
Let me...

18:45.207 --> 18:48.001
show you a new party trick
I came up with.

18:49.253 --> 18:52.339
Another party trick? After last time?

18:52.923 --> 18:56.885
If the mood gets any more hellish,
even I won't be able to-

18:56.969 --> 18:57.970
I'd...

18:58.804 --> 19:00.097
I'd like to see that.

19:03.183 --> 19:05.561
What are you going to do, Gero?

19:05.978 --> 19:08.772
Spew liquid DIY candy out of your mouth?

19:08.856 --> 19:12.151
Please don't ruin your chances
with Ureshino.

19:28.959 --> 19:31.795
Hey, it matches my scarf.

19:31.879 --> 19:34.089
And my favorite flowers!

19:34.548 --> 19:37.926
I thought all a party trick
had to do was get attention.

19:38.510 --> 19:40.053
But I guess I was wrong.

19:41.388 --> 19:43.182
You taught me that.

19:43.557 --> 19:48.395
The key is to face people head-on
and entertain them.

19:49.229 --> 19:50.480
Mr. Gero.

19:52.024 --> 19:55.152
I thought up a new trick, too.

19:55.861 --> 19:57.279
I'd like to show it off.

20:06.371 --> 20:12.878
They suck at talking, but if they can
communicate like this, so what?

20:16.381 --> 20:18.383
I had a great time.

20:18.634 --> 20:19.676
Same here.

20:20.469 --> 20:22.888
So I guess, uh...

20:23.931 --> 20:26.516
Be the best CEO you can.

20:27.893 --> 20:28.769
I will.

20:30.437 --> 20:33.357
I won't see you again, will I?

20:34.441 --> 20:36.735
Well, my mission's complete.

20:40.239 --> 20:42.950
I'm greedy, you know?

20:43.784 --> 20:46.161
There are so many things I want to do.

20:46.495 --> 20:50.791
And I don't want to neglect
Balzak or college at all.

20:58.131 --> 21:02.177
Or falling in love, either.

21:10.018 --> 21:12.437
Mr. Gero! Thank you for the other day!

21:12.688 --> 21:14.731
Shiori, I'm here to drive you home.

21:16.316 --> 21:19.695
Mr. Gero, thank you so much for tonight.

21:20.529 --> 21:22.155
Oh, I almost forgot.

21:22.239 --> 21:24.783
Would you mind adding me as a friend?

21:25.033 --> 21:28.370
I'd like to see you again.

21:35.877 --> 21:41.133
I planned out 65,536 scenarios
for getting him to add me,

21:41.216 --> 21:43.719
but it still almost gave me
a heart attack.

21:44.636 --> 21:46.847
(Friends)

21:47.431 --> 21:52.102
Is Ureshino into me,
or was she just being polite?

21:52.185 --> 21:54.730
Who can say?

21:55.063 --> 21:59.651
Well, don't rush things and just focus
on developing your relationship.

22:02.195 --> 22:03.113
Right.

22:03.655 --> 22:04.489
Okay.

22:04.948 --> 22:07.200
Let's begin our next operation on Sunday.

22:07.284 --> 22:08.785
I can't do that day.

22:08.869 --> 22:10.912
How come? Got other plans?

22:11.330 --> 22:12.247
Yeah.

22:13.915 --> 22:16.001
A friend's wedding.

22:28.680 --> 22:30.891
Ah! Something smells fishy!

22:30.974 --> 22:32.809
I'm shocked, startled,
it's adding insult to injury

22:32.893 --> 22:34.144
I'm completely obsessed

22:34.227 --> 22:36.521
Ah! Something smells off!

22:36.605 --> 22:38.523
You're all bluff,
I'm sick and tired, so disappointed

22:38.607 --> 22:39.649
Bye-bye, mwah!

22:39.941 --> 22:42.694
It seems like I'm only good at

22:42.778 --> 22:45.530
workbooks for a child

22:45.614 --> 22:48.283
Even through infectious disease,
I want to love with you

22:48.366 --> 22:51.244
No! No! Love's in gridlock!

22:51.328 --> 22:53.747
Forever and ever, I love you,
Shake Na Baby

22:53.830 --> 22:56.958
Darling, heading toward a twisted signpost

22:57.042 --> 22:59.461
Heart fluttering, I love you,
Shake Na Baby

22:59.544 --> 23:02.297
Just the two of us, consolation prize

23:12.557 --> 23:14.684
Ah, the scent of dance

23:14.768 --> 23:16.520
I'm completely obsessed

23:16.603 --> 23:17.938
with you as you flutter down

23:18.021 --> 23:20.190
Ah, something smells off

23:20.273 --> 23:22.400
I'm blown away by you

23:22.484 --> 23:23.401
Bye-bye, mwah!

23:23.485 --> 23:26.530
It seems like I'm only good at

23:26.613 --> 23:29.282
workbooks for a child

23:29.366 --> 23:32.119
I want us to share even our growing pains

23:32.202 --> 23:34.871
No! No! Love's in gridlock!

23:35.080 --> 23:37.582
Forever and ever, I love you,
Shake Na Baby

23:37.666 --> 23:40.669
Darling, heading toward
a stagnant signpost

23:40.752 --> 23:43.255
Heart fluttering, I love you,
Shake Na Baby

23:43.338 --> 23:46.091
Singing a grand chorus cheekily

23:47.968 --> 23:51.054
Do you think I can pull off
a marriage that perfect?

23:51.138 --> 23:52.639
I promise
I'll find one for you.

23:52.722 --> 23:53.557
Leave.

23:53.640 --> 23:56.852
Next time: "The Bug Master's Wedding."
